              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AmaGerishoni, olunye usendo lwamaLevi, anikwa engxenyeni yesizwe sakoManase iGolani eBashani, umuzi wokuphephela umbulali, lamadlelo alo, leAshitarothi lamadlelo alo, imizi emibili. ",
          "type": "text",
