          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esizweni sakoNafitali anikwa iKedeshi eGalili, umuzi wokuphephela umbulali, lamadlelo alo, leHamothi‐Dori lamadlelo alo, leKaritani lamadlelo alo, imizi emithathu. ",
